{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-cli/tests/common/mod.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T21:26:26.947378Z","id":"f4db09c28d6b47b37308020f64979d1aa49dcfdb277b8a02d28b2f9665ec543d","body":{"detail":"Failure: scripts/bazel-test.sh --ci at 91b09e07a (main) fails `Clippy //crates/clax-cli:descriptors` with `error: function as_clax is never used` (-D dead-code implied by -D warnings): tests/descriptors.rs compiles the shared common module and calls no as_clax. CI's bazel job stays red until it is used there, gated, or allowed.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":16},"end":{"line":16},"content_hash":"9bbe0f626bc14c602d34b29662f5d2b2d5d84c72d0c584f5d034e8ee8fb2f082"},"summary":"`as_clax` is unused in the descriptors test target, so clippy -D warnings fails //crates/clax-cli:descriptors on main","tags":["ci","build","session:claude-code:d1f51555-8e8f-4c11-acd6-673f773ac34d"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-cli/tests/common/mod.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-11-04T22:37:03.955406Z","id":"5d1c4ad69cc3a227db97330d96216f79a174cc0833259165b512f70038ba97ff","body":{"detail":"Env::cmd runs `clax hook` with the product's deadlines (2 to 4 s a run, 1 to 3 s a request: budget in crates/clax-commands/src/commands/hook.rs); CLAX_TEST_HOOK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS only shortens them. A hook that misses its budget prints nothing, so tests that assert what a hook prints (crates/clax-cli/tests/connect.rs a_remote_hook_prints_its_comments_when_clips_do_not_come, which relies on the prompt hook's 4 s deadline to give up on held clips, and the hook runs in cli.rs and journal.rs) can fail under load. Lifting the budget for tests needs a product setting; while a hook that gives up on its take loses the comment, no test can assert delivery across two hook runs instead.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":64},"end":{"line":91},"content_hash":"03dfca5972bced322678dcb0f3da5056bf749eda11e20836f0ecb2c358bf73cb"},"summary":"CLI tests run hooks on their real budgets, so a heavily loaded machine can fail them","tags":["testing","timing","session:claude-code:8e745615-4eb7-451a-a3d4-35f6e2615e17"]}}
